  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Humanitarian Law reporting project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2019, the UK published a voluntary report on the implementation of International Humanitarian Law (IHL) at a domestic level. This project is working with the British Red Cross (BRC) to support other states to produce similar voluntary reports that demonstrate national implementation of IHL in their laws and policies.</narrative>
  </description>
